# PCES best-path test (src/ui-touch/PcesApp.h): the drawer's PCES tile, web host build,
# demo backend with a canned PCES station on Hilltop Repeater and a 2-hop route to Diego:
#   WADA_DATA_DIR=$(mktemp -d) WADA_DEMO_PCES=1 web/build-host/wadamesh-host --headless --script web/scripts/pces-route.wada --shots <dir>
# A fresh data dir starts at first-run setup; the first tap skips it.
# Expect: t4 target Diego (BF78 > 7F33), Hilltop picked as server (advertises PCES);
# t5 steps 1-2 logged (first hop BF78, login, INFO: 42 links, limit -7.50 dB);
# t6/t7 PATH BF78 > 7F33 after the 12 s floor, 72/100, +6.50 dB, accepted and installed.
wait 5000
tap 60 283
wait 2500
tap 697 360
wait 1500
tap 621 75
wait 1500
tap 400 162
wait 1200
tap 400 446
wait 1200
shot pces-t4-target
tap 400 262
wait 6000
shot pces-t5-info
wait 14000
shot pces-t6-done
drag 400 420 400 100
wait 1000
shot pces-t7-scrolled
quit
